## How to Update

If you've added new dependencies or changed your stack:

```bash
/update-practices
```

This will re-scan your project and update the loaded templates.

## Manual Override

To load a different stack configuration:

```bash
/setup-stack --force --stack=typescript-react
```

## Debugging

If templates aren't loading correctly:

1. Check `.claude/conditionals/_index.md` for available stacks
2. Verify your project has the required fingerprint files
3. Ensure dependencies are properly listed in package.json/requirements.txt/etc.
4. Use `--skip-init-check` flag if testing in the template repo itself
